        user = vm.addr(userPrivateKey);

        uint256 _debt = 1e18;
        uint256 flAmount = _debtToCollateral(_debt);
-      uint256 marginAmount = 5 ether;
+      uint256 marginAmount = 5 ether;
```        
Also in the same test adjust the Debt which is used to create the TradeData.
```diff
