-           _getExactOutCollateralToDebtTradeData(debt, stEthAmount * COLLATERAL_BUFFER / SLIPPAGE_PRECISION);
+          _getExactOutCollateralToDebtTradeData(debt + 17e17, stEthAmount * COLLATERAL_BUFFER / SLIPPAGE_PRECISION);
```

Run the test `test_ZapCloseCdp_WithStEth_LowLeverage`  again using `forge test --match-test test_ZapCloseCdp_WithStEth_LowLeverage -vvv`
